WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:05.700
Crows represent order.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:06.660
Security.

00:00:07.420 --> 00:00:08.340
Safety.

00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:11.680
Batman gave up on us.

00:00:12.240 --> 00:00:14.460
The bad's not coming back.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:18.580
Something's up. Eyes everywhere.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.500
Hello said Alice.

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:27.880
Shall we believe the Crows will protect us?

00:00:30.360 --> 00:00:31.700
Agent Moore, do you copy?

00:00:31.980 --> 00:00:32.980
Do you copy?

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:36.160
Sophie's missing.
I thought you should know.

00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.360
Hey, dad.

00:00:38.360 --> 00:00:39.420
We're gonna find her.

00:00:39.420 --> 00:00:40.500
Then, let me help.

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:41.560
Bad idea.

00:00:42.800 --> 00:00:44.100
Where'd you get this?

00:00:44.380 --> 00:00:46.400
What happened to staying out of it?

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:51.960
Is there something you'd like to report to your squad?

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:01.720
Don't run in without proper backup.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.280
I do not want her getting in the way.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:14.700
Curiouser and curiouser.

00:01:14.980 --> 00:01:16.120
What do you want?

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.760
I need you to send your father a message.

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:23.140
You're all I have left, Kate.

00:01:24.080 --> 00:01:26.400
And I don't want to lose you too.

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:31.880
Wayne Security.

00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.320
You owe my boss a new door.

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:35.240
Your boss is my cousin.

00:01:37.600 --> 00:01:39.340
You don't wanna go near that.

00:01:39.680 --> 00:01:41.840
You're seriously not supposed 
to know what's down there.

00:01:41.840 --> 00:01:43.680
So, I have this thing with rules...

00:02:00.160 --> 00:02:01.980
I need you to fix his suit.

00:02:01.980 --> 00:02:03.660
The suit is literal perfection.

00:02:03.660 --> 00:02:04.940
It will be,

00:02:05.420 --> 00:02:06.880
when it fits a woman.

00:02:19.000 --> 00:02:20.660
You're a female Bruce Wayne.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:23.860
Awesome, hilarious, handsome.

00:02:36.960 --> 00:02:38.340
Look! It's Batman!

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.320
They think I'm him.

00:02:43.880 --> 00:02:46.780
I'm not about to let a man 
take credit for a woman's work.

